{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-P01-rgb-frame-preconditions-v1", "kind": "constraint", "title": "物体检测（P01）：XR-1 三路 RGB 的前置约束", "content": "P01 执行前必须满足：agentview left/right 与 eye-in-hand 三路 RGB 中目标相机帧可读、时间戳有效且分辨率为 256×256；检测阈值由 score_threshold 显式给出（本平台 P01 影子绑定用 0.10）。", "applicability": ["P01", "atomic:P01"], "preconditions": ["agentview left/right 或 eye-in-hand 的 RGB 帧可读且时间戳有效"], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["rgb_camera", "object_detector"], "evidence_refs": ["catalogs/v2.2/atomic_skills.json#P01", "catalogs/v2.2/skill_bundles/P01/skill.md", "configs/runs/robocasa365_xr1_sidecar_smoke.yaml"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-P01-detection-completeness-v1", "kind": "procedure", "title": "物体检测（P01）：什么才算做完", "content": "P01 的完成判据是生成当前帧对象检测观测，且所有检测框合法（落在 256×256 内）并达到 score_threshold；返回空列表不构成完成，此时节点应判 TIMEOUT，而不是假定检测成功继续执行。", "applicability": ["P01", "atomic:P01"], "preconditions": ["三路 RGB 目标帧可读且时间戳有效"], "verification": ["生成当前帧对象检测观测", "所有检测框合法且分数达到 score_threshold"], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["rgb_camera", "object_detector"], "evidence_refs": ["catalogs/v2.2/atomic_skills.json#P01", "catalogs/v2.2/skill_bundles/P01/skill.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-P02-segmentation-inputs-v1", "kind": "constraint", "title": "实例分割（P02）：输入必须是同帧检测结果", "content": "P02 的 detections 必须来自与待分割图像同帧的 P01 输出；跨帧复用检测框会让掩码与 RGB 不一致，此类失败按 INPUT_INVALID 处理，重试同一输入不会变好。", "applicability": ["P02", "atomic:P02"], "preconditions": [], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["rgb_camera", "visual_grounding"], "evidence_refs": ["catalogs/v2.2/atomic_skills.json#P02", "catalogs/v2.2/skill_bundles/P02/skill.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-P02-mask-alignment-v1", "kind": "fact", "title": "实例分割（P02）：掩码格式与分辨率对齐", "content": "P02 的 mask_format 在本平台固定为 png_rle，掩码尺寸必须与 256×256 的 RGB 帧逐像素对齐，掩码引用与图像引用须同帧；不同帧的掩码视为无效证据。", "applicability": ["P02", "atomic:P02"], "preconditions": [], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["rgb_camera", "visual_grounding"], "evidence_refs": ["catalogs/v2.2/atomic_skills.json#P02", "catalogs/v2.2/skill_bundles/P02/skill.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-P06-attribute-candidates-v1", "kind": "procedure", "title": "物体属性识别（P06）：取值只能落在候选集内", "content": "P06 的 attribute_keys 必须由先行 P01/P02 定位到的 object_id 支撑，输出取值只允许出现在 candidate_values 内；候选集之外的取值即使视觉上合理也判 INPUT_INVALID。", "applicability": ["P06", "atomic:P06"], "preconditions": [], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["rgb_camera", "visual_grounding"], "evidence_refs": ["catalogs/v2.2/atomic_skills.json#P06", "catalogs/v2.2/skill_bundles/P06/skill.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-P12-published-state-keys-v1", "kind": "fact", "title": "机器人状态读取（P12）：XR-1 只发布五个 state.* 键", "content": "RoboCasa365 + XR-1 环境只发布五个 state.* 键：state.end_effector_position_relative(3)、state.end_effector_rotation_relative(4)、state.base_position(3)、state.base_rotation(4)、state.gripper_qpos(2)。ee_pose 由前两者合成，base_pose 由 base_position/base_rotation 合成，gripper_state 对应 gripper_qpos。", "applicability": ["P12", "atomic:P12"], "preconditions": [], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["mobile_manipulation", "task_graph_execution"], "evidence_refs": ["impl_docs/plans/0021-atomic-skill-backend-rollout.md", "impl_docs/changes/2026-09-13-atomic-skill-state-segment-attribute-backends.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-P12-unsupported-fields-v1", "kind": "constraint", "title": "机器人状态读取（P12）：超出五键的字段请求必然失败", "content": "P12 请求五键之外的状态（关节力矩、关节级通道、飞行/定位类字段）时本平台没有对应通道，会得到 CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE；该失败不可重试，应改道到五键可派生的字段。", "applicability": ["P12", "atomic:P12"], "preconditions": [], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["mobile_manipulation", "task_graph_execution"], "evidence_refs": ["impl_docs/plans/0021-atomic-skill-backend-rollout.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-M01-ee-linear-delta-v1", "kind": "constraint", "title": "直线 EE 运动（M01）：按 base 系 delta 目标下发", "content": "M01 的输入是 delta 语义的 EE 目标（input_type=delta、input_ref_frame=base），当前位置反馈来自 state.end_effector_position_relative；把绝对坐标当作 delta 下发会让动作越界被拒。", "applicability": ["M01", "atomic:M01"], "preconditions": [], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["mobile_manipulation"], "evidence_refs": ["catalogs/v2.2/atomic_skills.json#M01", "impl_docs/changes/2026-09-13-m01-m03-m04-ee-motion.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-M02-waypoints-ordering-v1", "kind": "procedure", "title": "折线 EE 运动（M02）：waypoints 时序与跨度约束", "content": "M02 的 waypoints 至少两点、时序单调，相邻点跨度不得超过单次执行时域内可达的距离；跨度过大时先用 M01 分段，而不是在一个 M02 调用里塞入整条轨迹。", "applicability": ["M02", "atomic:M02"], "preconditions": [], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["mobile_manipulation"], "evidence_refs": ["catalogs/v2.2/atomic_skills.json#M02", "impl_docs/changes/2026-09-13-m01-m03-m04-ee-motion.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-M03-rotate-in-place-v1", "kind": "constraint", "title": "原地姿态调整（M03）：只改姿态不动位置", "content": "M03 只调整 EE 姿态：位置分量必须与当前 state.end_effector_position_relative 一致，位置偏移超过容差即判 INPUT_INVALID；需要同时改变位置时应改用 M04。", "applicability": ["M03", "atomic:M03"], "preconditions": [], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["mobile_manipulation"], "evidence_refs": ["catalogs/v2.2/atomic_skills.json#M03", "impl_docs/changes/2026-09-13-m01-m03-m04-ee-motion.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-M04-ee-pose-composition-v1", "kind": "procedure", "title": "EE 目标姿态（M04）：7 维 base 系位姿与四元数规范化", "content": "M04 的目标是 base 系下的 7 维位姿 [x,y,z,qx,qy,qz,qw]，四元数须归一化；本平台不发布深度与力信息，姿态误差只能由三路 RGB 与 state.end_effector_rotation_relative 间接核对。", "applicability": ["M04", "atomic:M04"], "preconditions": [], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["mobile_manipulation"], "evidence_refs": ["catalogs/v2.2/atomic_skills.json#M04", "impl_docs/changes/2026-09-13-m01-m03-m04-ee-motion.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-ee-motion-state-source-v1", "kind": "fact", "title": "EE 运动类技能的状态反馈只有五键 + 三路 RGB", "content": "M01–M04 的闭环反馈来源仅有五个 state.* 键与 agentview left/right、eye-in-hand 三路 RGB，没有力矩、接触或关节级通道；接触类判定必须改道视觉，或按 TIMEOUT 处理，不能假定存在力反馈。", "applicability": ["M01", "M02", "M03", "M04", "atomic:M01", "atomic:M02", "atomic:M03", "atomic:M04"], "preconditions": [], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["mobile_manipulation", "visual_grounding"], "evidence_refs": ["impl_docs/plans/0021-atomic-skill-backend-rollout.md", "impl_docs/changes/2026-09-13-atomic-skill-state-segment-attribute-backends.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-scrub-cutting-board-rgb-observation-v1", "kind": "fact", "title": "ScrubCuttingBoard（target50）：观测边界", "content": "ScrubCuttingBoard 在 target50 / target split 下的观测是 256×256 的三路 RGB（agentview left/right + eye-in-hand）；切削板、刀具与餐具的位置和状态只能经 P01/P02/P06 从 RGB 恢复，环境不提供对象级真值。", "applicability": ["task:ScrubCuttingBoard", "ScrubCuttingBoard", "task_set:target50", "global"], "preconditions": [], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": ["rgb_camera", "visual_grounding"], "evidence_refs": ["configs/runs/robocasa365_xr1_sidecar_smoke.yaml", "impl_docs/plans/0021-atomic-skill-backend-rollout.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
{"record_type": "knowledge_entry_snapshot", "entry": {"schema_version": 1, "knowledge_id": "kb-reach-platform-failure-retry-rule-v1", "kind": "failure_rule", "title": "失败码与重试策略（本平台可用通道）", "content": "本平台只有五键状态与三路 RGB 通道，因此可重试的失败仅限 TIMEOUT；INPUT_INVALID、CAPABILITY_UNAVAILABLE、CANCELLED、VERIFIER_UNAVAILABLE 应改道或上报，而不是消耗重试预算。", "applicability": ["*", "global"], "preconditions": [], "verification": [], "source_robot_profile": "xr1_mobile_manipulator", "compatible_robot_profiles": ["xr1_mobile_manipulator"], "required_capabilities": [], "evidence_refs": ["catalogs/v2.2/atomic_skills.json#P01", "impl_docs/plans/0021-atomic-skill-backend-rollout.md"], "state": "validated", "source_type": "hand_authored_platform_boundary", "version": "1", "created_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:10:00+00:00"}}
